@startuml ReceiverBranchLabItemCapability
!include ddd_lib.puml
' 聚合根：ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityAggregate；业务范围：接收院区对标准医疗项目的独立承接白名单配置；不包含动态查询。

Person('ReceiverUser','接收方用户')
Person('PlatformOperator','平台运营人员')

Enum('ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityStatusEnum')[
    院区可承接项目配置状态
    --属性--
    启用(Enabled 1)
    停用(Disabled 2)
]

Enum('ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityBatchIssueCodeEnum')[
    批量新增项目问题类型
    --属性--
    标准医疗项目失效(StandardItemUnavailable 1)
    已有启用配置(CapabilityAlreadyEnabled 2)
    已有停用配置(CapabilityDisabledExists 3)
    接收项目对照缺失(ReceiverMappingMissing 4)
    接收项目对照不唯一(ReceiverMappingAmbiguous 5)
]

FacadeCommand('BatchCreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilitiesCommand')[
    批量新增院区可承接项目
    --入参--
    接收医院编码(ReceiverHospitalCode String)
    接收院区编码(ReceiverBranchCode String)
    标准医疗项目编码列表(MedicalStandardItemCodes String[])
    --结果--
    是否已应用(Applied Boolean)
    已创建ID列表(CreatedIds Guid[])
    项目问题列表(Issues [StandardItemCode, IssueType, Message][])
    --规则--
    1.一次提交一个或多个用户明确选择的标准医疗项目，不自动生成或回填白名单
    2.先对整批项目校验目录有效性、既有配置和接收项目对照，再执行写入
    3.全部项目通过时在同一事务内创建全部配置；任一项目未通过时整批零写入
    4.项目级预期问题逐项返回标准项目编码、稳定问题类型和展示原因
    5.请求、组织、登录上下文、上游服务和数据库异常继续按平台统一异常处理
]

Command('CreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand')[
    新增院区可承接项目
    --入参--
    接收医院编码(ReceiverHospitalCode String)
    接收院区编码(ReceiverBranchCode String)
    标准医疗项目编码(MedicalStandardItemCode String)
    --规则--
    1.接收医院、接收院区和标准医疗项目编码构成全生命周期唯一组合
    2.新增后配置状态默认为启用
    3.当前接收院区必须存在唯一启用的对应项目对照，且标准医疗项目当前有效
    4.接收方用户仅能维护当前接收院区；平台运营人员按权限范围维护
]
DomainEvent('ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCreatedEvent')[
    院区可承接项目已创建
    --属性--
    ID
    接收医院编码(ReceiverHospitalCode String)
    接收院区编码(ReceiverBranchCode String)
    标准医疗项目编码(MedicalStandardItemCode String)
    配置状态(Status ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityStatus)
]
ReceiverUser --> CreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand
PlatformOperator --> CreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand
CreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand ..> ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCreatedEvent : send

ReceiverUser --> BatchCreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilitiesCommand
PlatformOperator --> BatchCreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilitiesCommand
BatchCreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilitiesCommand ..> CreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand : 全批校验通过后逐项创建

Command('EnableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand')[
    启用院区可承接项目
    --入参--
    ID
    --规则--
    1.当前接收院区必须存在唯一启用的对应项目对照，且标准医疗项目当前有效
    2.启用只改变配置状态，不保存当前接收项目快照
]
DomainEvent('ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityEnabledEvent')[
    院区可承接项目已启用
    --属性--
    ID
    配置状态(Status ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityStatus)
]
ReceiverUser --> EnableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand
PlatformOperator --> EnableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand
EnableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand ..> ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityEnabledEvent : send

Command('DisableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand')[
    停用院区可承接项目
    --入参--
    ID
    ..
    停用原因(DisableReason String)
    --规则--
    1.停用原因必填
    2.停用保留配置记录，不物理删除
]
DomainEvent('ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityDisabledEvent')[
    院区可承接项目已停用
    --属性--
    ID
    配置状态(Status ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityStatus)
    停用原因(DisableReason String)
]
ReceiverUser --> DisableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand
PlatformOperator --> DisableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand
DisableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand ..> ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityDisabledEvent : send

Aggregate('ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityAggregate')[
    院区可承接项目
    --属性--
    ID(Id Guid)
    ..
    接收医院编码(ReceiverHospitalCode String)
    接收院区编码(ReceiverBranchCode String)
    标准医疗项目编码(MedicalStandardItemCode String)
    配置状态(Status ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityStatus)
    停用原因(DisableReason String?)
    --规则--
    1.配置采用严格白名单，未配置即不可承接
    2.配置只支持新增、启用和停用，不物理删除
    3.实际可用性由配置状态、当前接收院区项目对照和标准医疗项目当前状态动态计算，不保存为聚合状态
    4.启用后依赖异常不改变配置状态；依赖恢复后动态恢复实际可用
]

CreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand .. ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityAggregate
BatchCreateReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilitiesCommand .. ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityAggregate
EnableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand .. ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityAggregate
DisableReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityCommand .. ReceiverBranchLabItemCapabilityAggregate

@enduml
